{"id":"kragen","lemma":"Kragen","pos":"noun","rank":4549,"glosses":["collar","neck"],"ipa":"/ˈkraːɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/De-Kragen.ogg/De-Kragen.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Kragens","plural":"Kragen"},"examples":[{"text":"Dieser Kragen ist zu eng.","en":"This collar's too tight.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"narrow, tight"}]},{"text":"Er packte mich am Kragen.","en":"He grabbed me by the collar.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to pack","l":"packen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"at the / on the"},null]},{"text":"Du hast einen Fleck am Kragen.","en":"Your collar has a stain on it.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"stain"},{"g":"at the / on the"},null]},{"text":"Ich brauche ein Hemd mit einem steifen Kragen.","en":"I need a shirt with a stiff collar.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"shirt"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"stiff, rigid","l":"steif"},null]},{"text":"Da platzte mir der Kragen.","en":"That was the last straw.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to burst, to pop","l":"platzen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}